Z||000001||Cheever2||01-20-2001||11:22 PM||||I'm with ya, Ray!  Check my profile, it shows my similar interests.  I started following it way back when Eddie Cheever was the only American driver.  Kept watching Eddie and kept watching F-1 ever since.  Used to watch Senna & Prost dueling it out.  Don't have cable or satellite right now, so I just have to keep up online.<P>How did you like F-1 at Indy last year?  I thought they did a good job with it.  Shame they had to take away so many infield parking places.  My favorite spot was around turn 3 or 4.  Went often for Indy qualifying & practices (when I lived near Cincinnati), and went on race day to see Eddie win, it was a perfect day!<P>Don't get me started, I could go on and on...<BR><P>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I>||||reg||6
